    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u2665\u2665 ADD IN WISHLIST!! \u2665\u2665</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>\u300aBareback Reincarnation - It's Just That Easy to Brave a Different World\u300bis a card battle adventure game developed by Ex-Erotia and published by BokiBoki Games.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Story</h2>The protagonist, a weary corporate slave, found himself unexpectedly transported to an Isekai during overtime work.<br>To his amazement, he discovered that his stamina recovers at an extraordinary rate, and even more astonishingly,<br> his seminal fluid possesses the unique ability to &quot;enhance magical essence&quot; and &quot;strengthen skills&quot; for female beings without causing pregnancy!<br><br>Embark on an exciting adventure as a wandering traveler in this fantasy realm, wielding the powers of a &quot;Demonoid&quot; to conquer the hearts of the girls.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/4f1ffdf8f4baa264ba2956ae2f075fda.poster.avif?t=1741239327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/4f1ffdf8f4baa264ba2956ae2f075fda.webm?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/4f1ffdf8f4baa264ba2956ae2f075fda.mp4?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A former member of the mercenary group, he ran a bar after retiring, providing drinks and information.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/67b93a4d750ba1213280bbae99a4616e.poster.avif?t=1741239327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/67b93a4d750ba1213280bbae99a4616e.webm?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/67b93a4d750ba1213280bbae99a4616e.mp4?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The former adventure teammate of the tavern proprietress, who is good at using knives and poison traps.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/880db3df3dc784d42288b1c557fe8949.poster.avif?t=1741239327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/880db3df3dc784d42288b1c557fe8949.webm?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/880db3df3dc784d42288b1c557fe8949.mp4?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The former adventure teammate of the tavern proprietress, who serves as a priest in the main city temple.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/e7dd97b2d51eaa77ad9c2cc1777bde92.poster.avif?t=1741239327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/e7dd97b2d51eaa77ad9c2cc1777bde92.webm?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/e7dd97b2d51eaa77ad9c2cc1777bde92.mp4?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A fighter with unknown origins, suspecting that the hero has colluded with the devil.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Basic gameplay</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/eb3ba98267d59c24a65cbaf9729ddd1d.poster.avif?t=1741239327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/eb3ba98267d59c24a65cbaf9729ddd1d.webm?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/eb3ba98267d59c24a65cbaf9729ddd1d.mp4?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/7a40c4a52af0b708211d4946c98b07df.poster.avif?t=1741239327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/7a40c4a52af0b708211d4946c98b07df.webm?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/7a40c4a52af0b708211d4946c98b07df.mp4?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>At the beginning, the player will randomly draw five cards.<br>After deciding the order of playing the cards, press the FIGHT button, and the arranged cards will attack in order.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/854a7a2cc45ded4a3d796cf7dd3088b5.poster.avif?t=1741239327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/854a7a2cc45ded4a3d796cf7dd3088b5.webm?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/854a7a2cc45ded4a3d796cf7dd3088b5.mp4?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/5999d8eff37682b2011cb7d2d1523960.poster.avif?t=1741239327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/5999d8eff37682b2011cb7d2d1523960.webm?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/5999d8eff37682b2011cb7d2d1523960.mp4?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>When defending, as long as you play a card of the same color, the attack is invalid.<br>If it corresponds to a card of a different color, the attack is established and damage is dealt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/73ce68cc9b96553bf222c0a21543d083.avif?t=1741239327\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/fa091a2781176695ba1ec1002b6b1b84.poster.avif?t=1741239327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/fa091a2781176695ba1ec1002b6b1b84.webm?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533830/extras/fa091a2781176695ba1ec1002b6b1b84.mp4?t=1741239327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can use the money you get after the battle to buy the same cards in the store, and get better abilities by synthesizing and strengthening the cards in the card library.<br>   ",
